## BPMN Diagram: Smart Agricultural Supply Chain & Market Intelligence

flowchart LR
    A[Farmer Registers] --> B[Add Harvest]
    B --> C[Assign Storage Facility]
    C --> D[Monitor Storage Conditions]
    D --> E[Record Market Prices]
    E --> F[Buyer Interested]
    F --> G[Transaction Negotiation]
    G --> H[Finalize Sale]
    H --> I[Delivery]
    I --> J[Payment]
    J --> K[Feedback & Ratings]
    K --> L[Update Credit Score]


### Process Description

* **Farmer Registration:** Farmer data stored in FARMERS table.
* **Harvest Entry:** Harvest record created under HARVESTS.
* **Storage Management:** HARVESTS references STORAGE_FACILITIES.
* **Market Price Tracking:** MARKET_PRICES continuously updated.
* **Buyer Matching:** BUYERS & TRANSACTIONS define deals.
* **Transaction Lifecycle:** Negotiation → Delivery → Payment → Ratings.
* **Credit Score Update:** Based on ratings, payment behavior.
